# Service: Request trajectory planning from the GA node.
# The GA node receives the scenario and runs optimization using its
# configured parameters (loaded from YAML at startup).

# --- Scenario ---
geometry_msgs/Point start
geometry_msgs/Point goal
gahomotopy_msgs/Obstacle[] obstacles
string experiment_name            # label for this run
---
# --- Result ---
bool success                      # true if a valid path was found
gahomotopy_msgs/TrajectoryResult trajectory